{"type":"message","id":"5b160ff2","parentId":"7644d76b","timestamp":"2026-03-18T14:19:30.291Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"A new session was started via /new or /reset. Run your Session Startup sequence - read the required files before responding to the user. Then greet the user in your configured persona, if one is provided. Be yourself - use your defined voice, mannerisms, and mood. Keep it to 1-3 sentences and ask what they want to do. If the runtime model differs from default_model in the system prompt, mention the default model. Do not mention internal steps, files, tools, or reasoning.\nCurrent time: Wednesday, March 18th, 2026 — 2:19 PM (UTC) / 2026-03-18 14:19 UTC"}],"timestamp":1773843570288}}
{"type":"message","id":"ca7bc1b5","parentId":"5b160ff2","timestamp":"2026-03-18T14:19:34.625Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"","thinkingSignature":"{\"id\":\"rs_051741f188571b560169bab475cb0c8191be1a7170bf3190bf\",\"type\":\"reasoning\",\"encrypted_content\":\"gAAAAABpurR2ogHKAF1F6R900F-OscuVNbt9M95QiOJk2GHPEby4U6GdCrzveQflInT1tGdgf-mraP-YUtuCdkAoaE5_nueZ8qFD374n-XCdC00MATyzL0iPdXYnH8kJZqHYd8_S5tk-z7RLmflGUog21GE8tzZI3p3RYTO68lyEcdlTCA7Zvbrqlo9P1tyDwOQLxYRi0KiT_Cgevx1JNkxeAOuu2DIMoMavOLZjP4aizgRTrjfH7I3lrLJoQ3rtzysAOnZSCPY9qotaVaI4XUKRmR24dGharWwZvfuECQVxMFZQ8PlfdEUCnDFdPrCDLp_J-ZxK5JuIM6Poc_bdNe8ijepqEbBIg-l1SXBodypwe4a0KP2NvBkayja6ataiwJVzj0dKIewr7dd4v33pZEC6JGoVseN1hI-9fFVFuKJC_Y7xG3lHUEw2WhwIsIFmPSmK863uG0eGaLq_cHg5RlsweIv2wjlZxlrT1I7z7q3aTxO9_pwJPfA0hKX81Yhmh8jmShibgufAAbOC41CJaTJhXfsU7MP_orFLbCPMdW7BSdZxt9QCgMsYqQljmTpkjNyAyLgI2PWcgOteLunBCYl9YqzJFakf1DhwubO8aPTn0Nn4RAEVzBCWHrAjlm60hIdqFhUkAbdn379dGHrdtWcK2ocV3vNWGqnUM4z-fa47HX-j2NJfoHkaHrfIR-gKhFhb3gm2gDNSLdTNfpeSmTSPANY1EnqbRT7ks0uM-apY6O0XQrfaPmnvt0XHhr-JQcdyf_gQCqwMk2ygESeBauiQ3qjjbU2xxWjpih5ceiDolecFku9QKy6FO4qc0MUpoPljmSbGIDjkhilagAJcK6BxZmr6zqQJ4A7wWvzd4L3l7Njmch5PWDTzF_JvfcfJMElJNWqfTm3_nnY1zmShqp1FFyegu29Aa8AqYDCxGCNuRPrHRmbGv1G2iMoDkRhNDmK3_ZCNT1OA\",\"summary\":[]}"},{"type":"text","text":"[[reply_to_current]] Hi — I’m ready. What would you like to work on?","textSignature":"{\"v\":1,\"id\":\"msg_051741f188571b560169bab476801881918875b57b57ea5684\",\"phase\":\"final_answer\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":8118,"output":45,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":8163,"cost":{"input":0.020295,"output":0.000675,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.02097}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1773843570290}}
