{"type":"message","id":"7c99342c","parentId":"b2561355","timestamp":"2026-03-18T14:26:27.322Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"toolCall","id":"call_y8xT6YzjyxmXqfxfHYmsM67u|fc_051741f188571b560169bab60e13908191b81f2423dc312d94","name":"edit","arguments":{"file_path":"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/SKILL.md","old_string":"4. Read the upload response JSON and build the remote image path by concatenating:\n   - `path + filename`\n5. Replace every `<image_path_here>` placeholder in the fixed prototype JSON with the uploaded remote image path.\n6. Send the full resulting JSON payload to:\n   - `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/`\n7. Return the raw response inside a minimal envelope that includes:\n","new_string":"5. Read the upload response JSON and build the remote image path by concatenating:\n   - `path + filename`\n6. Replace every `<image_path_here>` placeholder in the fixed prototype JSON with the uploaded remote image path.\n7. Send the full resulting JSON payload to:\n   - `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/`\n8. If the pipeline response exposes an analyzer `file_path` URL, download it only to a short-lived temp file, send it to Telegram with `openclaw message send`, and delete the temp file immediately after the send attempt.\n9. Return the raw response inside a minimal envelope that includes:\n"},"partialJson":"{\"file_path\":\"/home/node/.openclaw/skills/kidney-pipeline-execution/SKILL.md\",\"old_string\":\"4. Read the upload response JSON and build the remote image path by concatenating:\\n   - `path + filename`\\n5. Replace every `<image_path_here>` placeholder in the fixed prototype JSON with the uploaded remote image path.\\n6. Send the full resulting JSON payload to:\\n   - `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/`\\n7. Return the raw response inside a minimal envelope that includes:\\n\",\"new_string\":\"5. Read the upload response JSON and build the remote image path by concatenating:\\n   - `path + filename`\\n6. Replace every `<image_path_here>` placeholder in the fixed prototype JSON with the uploaded remote image path.\\n7. Send the full resulting JSON payload to:\\n   - `http://looporchestra.sytes.net:4001/admin/prototype_execution/prototype_execution/`\\n8. If the pipeline response exposes an analyzer `file_path` URL, download it only to a short-lived temp file, send it to Telegram with `openclaw message send`, and delete the temp file immediately after the send attempt.\\n9. Return the raw response inside a minimal envelope that includes:\\n\"}"}],"api":"openai-codex-responses","provider":"openai-codex","model":"gpt-5.4","usage":{"input":197,"output":290,"cacheRead":88832,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":89319,"cost":{"input":0.0004925,"output":0.00435,"cacheRead":0.022208,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0.027050499999999998}},"stopReason":"toolUse","timestamp":1773843977478}}
